 {!embed&&<section className=\"mt-5\"><div className=\"my-3 flex gap-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Learning sections\">{(['student','teacher'] as const).map(t=><button key={t} className=\"bio-button\" aria-pressed={tab===t} onClick={()=>setTab(t)}>{t==='student'?'Student activities':'Teacher guide'}</button>)}</div>\n {tab==='teacher'?<div className=\"bio-card\"><h2 className=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Teacher guide · 35-minute lesson</h2><p className=\"my-3 text-sm leading-7\"><strong>Learning objective:</strong> {lesson.principle}</p><ol className=\"list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-7\"><li>0–5 min: elicit an explanation and record predictions.</li><li>5–15 min: expand classroom view, then model one change or stage at a time.</li><li>15–25 min: {lesson.teacher}</li><li>25–30 min: pairs complete the student investigations and explain their evidence.</li><li>30–35 min: use a practice question as an exit ticket; ask for a reason as well as an answer.</li></ol><h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Misconception check</h3><p className=\"my-2 text-sm leading-7\">{lesson.misconception}</p><h3 className=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Access and extension</h3><p className=\"my-2 text-sm leading-7\">Use step controls instead of timed playback, keyboard controls and read-aloud. Let one learner operate while a partner explains; swap roles. Extend the task by identifying one limitation of the model.</p><button className=\"bio-button\" onClick={()=>{setTab('student');setRunning(false);}}>Open student practice</button></div>:<div className=\"bio-card\"><h2 className=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Investigate and explain</h2><ol className=\"my-3 list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-7\">{lesson.investigation.map(t=><li key={t}>{t}</li>)}</ol><h3 className=\"mt-5 font-semibold\">Practice · question {question+1}/{lesson.questions.length}</h3><p className=\"my-3 text-sm leading-7\">{quiz.prompt}</p><div className=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">{quiz.choices.map((c,i)=><button key={c} c